---
import { lenses } from '../data/profile';
---

<section id="lenses-v2" class="relative py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="section-shell-v2">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow-v2 mb-5">Three lenses</p>
      <h2 class="text-balance text-4xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-5xl">
        Maps, markets, and media are the three lenses I keep coming back to.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        Entertainment, geospatial intelligence, and finance are not separate compartments —
        they are recurring ways of understanding what is happening behind the visible surface.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:mt-20 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-7">
      {lenses.map((lens, i) => (
        <article class="group rounded-2xl bg-paper-soft p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_24px_60px_-20px_rgba(11,20,19,0.18)] md:p-9">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-base font-medium text-accent">0{i + 1}</span>
            <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-hairline"></span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-medium leading-snug text-ink md:text-[1.65rem]">
            {lens.title}
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
            {lens.body}
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-7 space-y-3">
            {lens.signals.map((signal) => (
              <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
                <span class="mt-2 inline-block h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
                <span>{signal}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-5 rounded-2xl bg-ink p-8 text-paper-soft md:mt-14 md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-10 md:p-10">
      <div class="md:max-w-xs">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-accent-soft">Tool layer</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-medium leading-tight md:text-3xl">
          AI connects the lenses.
        </h3>
      </div>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-paper-soft/80 md:text-lg">
        AI, software, maps, data pipelines, and automation are the working layer:
        the way to search, connect, model, summarize, and build across entertainment,
        geospatial systems, and finance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
